      "source": "[![DIIT - UNLaM]([embedded image omitted])](https://ingenieria.unlam.edu.ar/)    \n2025 [Víctor A. Bettachini](mailto:vbettachini@unlam.edu.ar)  \n[![by-nc-sa_80x15.png]([embedded image omitted])](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\n\n---",
      "sourceSha256": "cedae8957109560ba42befee8c8d69b50ef01073191bdd5e21459abe6d15e88c",
      "outputs": [],
